    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d658">

                <pb facs="0685" n="635" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg635"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic">February 1,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>As soon as Crown approves, probably Monday, notice will be sent Cuba by
                    telegraph. I will then telegraph you.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
